      50.64,
      364.41,
      286.44,
      444.32
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.: KDS/KGK/4/2(1)/2013/11/LA. I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following Lands which are required for a public purpose",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      446.01,
      286.45,
      549.2
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Lands to be acquired: 02. Allotmeats of Land in total extent of 0.0045 Hectare depicted as Lot No. 01-02 in preliminary plan No. P.P. Maha 6387 prepared by Surveyer General situated in the Village of Welata and in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kandy and Gangawata Korale in Kandy District Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      551.12,
      286.52,
      609.72
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 \u2014 Name of Land: Assesment No. 753, Willium Gopallawa Mawatha Moonamale Estate and Mattapela; Owner: Urban Development Authority; Extent: 0.0035 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      611.16,
      286.48,
      697.04
    ],
    "text": "Boundary Schedule in North: Lot No. 01 in P.P. Maha 3737 and Lot No. 01 in P.P. Maha 3738; East: Lot No. 01 in P.P. Maha 3738; South: Lot No. 01 in P.P. Maha 3738 Lot No. 03 in P.P. Maha 3737 and Lot No. 02 in This Plan; West: Lot No. 02 in this Plan and Lot No. 01 in P.P. Maha 3737.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.56,
      539.4,
      431.6
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 02 \u2014 Name of Land: Moonamale Estate and Mattapela; Owner: Kandy Municipal Council; Extent: 0.0010 Hectare. Boundary Schedule in North: Lot No. 01 in P.P. Maha 3737 and Lot No. 01 in this Plan; East: Lot No. 01 in this Plan; South: Lot No. 03 in P.P. Maha 3737 and Madabowala Lane; West: Madabowala Lane.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      430.64,
      539.39,
      586.16
    ],
    "text": "Total: Extent: 0.0045 Hectare. All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Divisional Secretariat of Kandy Four Gravets and Gangawata Korale on the 30th day of July, 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 20th day of July, 2015 the nature of their interests in the Land the particulars of their claims for compensation of the acquisition of the said Land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      13.918607711791992
